# Every checkout is byte-identical to the repository: no line-ending conversion, ever.
# Windows checkouts default to core.autocrlf=true, which would rewrite the assets whose
# sidecars and ATTRIBUTION.md record them, and the scripts CI runs.
* -text

# Not text at all: no textual diffs or merges either.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.jar binary
*.p12 binary
